    <div class="sg-section">
      <div class="sg-title">Spacing &amp; layout</div>
      <p class="sg-desc">Spacing uses a rem-based scale, and section padding is fluid: <code>clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem)</code>. Maximum content widths: <strong>1200px</strong> (wide), <strong>780px</strong> (narrow), <strong>68ch</strong> (prose).</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
      <div class="sg-title">Accessibility</div>
      <p class="sg-desc">Visible focus rings using the gold accent, skip link that appears on focus, semantic landmarks, reduced-motion respected. See <a href="/accessibility/" class="inline-link">our accessibility statement</a> for full detail.</p>
    </div>

